{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Kassel, August 19\n\nMy dear Marie,\n\nI have arrived in Kassel safely. The journey was lively, though not exactly comfortable. After half a day in Halle with Hinrichs and a short sleep, we drove to Nordhausen at night. Yesterday morning at six o'clock the journey began with the students. One talks a lot in the carriage, and the young people are cheerful.\n\nHere in Kassel it is cool in the evening. I have drunk a small cup of wine and am now tired. The landscape along the way was beautiful, but the most important thing is that I am safe.\n\nGreetings to Karl and Immanuel. Kiss the children from me.\n\nYour G. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221235,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":151,"prompt_tokens":231,"total_tokens":382,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-G48DkRWuh0w5jNMXj1shR1VZTrb4rqBe","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":231,"prompt_ms":375.085,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.6237445887445887,"prompt_per_second":615.8604049748724,"predicted_n":151,"predicted_ms":3527.498,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.516653333333334,"predicted_per_second":42.52305741916792}}